From 0f65a0f4a451ec9af713ec8f3599d4ee60b11903 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hmty11 <darrenjeho@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:31:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 20/20] fix(notes): harden resume and PDF filtering; refuse
 site-local fetches

- Restore layout on full-prefix retries and discard invalid optional checkpoints safely.
- Classify navigation before header cleanup and constrain external conversion after PDF preflight.
- Preserve mixed prose, report filtered-empty PDFs, and deny fec0::/10.
